      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ONE MILLIE (5) gave her opponents no chance last start when she cruised to a 15 metres victory over 1609m at Port Pirie. This looks a sterner test than last time but she is capable of saluting again. WHENIMREADY (3) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 6 metres from the winner in fourth over 1770m at Albury. Has the benefit of a good draw. Meets some better types this time but a trip to the winners' circle is not out of the question. MURRA LANE (6) made it three top-three finishes in succession last start when he recovered from a break to finish 5 metres from the winner in third over 2070m at Gawler. Can't make any mistakes against this field but he is right in the mix. LIGHTNING BLING (2) scored two runs back then things went sour last time when he broke and finished 10 metres back in sixth over 2070m at Gawler. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Can't make any mistakes against this field but he is right in the mix.",
